# Wave W17-M (Route 109): bay sand — warm bay beach sand, swimmer-bright, the great curved beach’s own shore in fine pale gold (design: the harbor pier takes the ferries; the beach takes everyone else). Route 109’s own shore — the brightest, finest sand in the arc, split from Route 106’s town shallows by its open-beach register.
